  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1602.01 Applicable Liquid Fuels",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1602.01 Applicable Liquid Fuels. The following liquid fuels, whether blended or not, shall be subject to this chapter:\n\n(a) No. 2 oil;\n\n(b) No. 4 oil;\n\n(c) No. 5 oil;\n\n(d) No. 6 oil;\n\n(e) Kerosene-1 oil;\n\n(f) Kerosene-2 oil;\n\n(g) Jet A aviation fuel;\n\n(h) Jet A-1 aviation fuel;\n\n(i) Jet B aviation fuel;\n\n(j) JP-4 aviation fuel;\n\n(k) JP-8 aviation fuel;\n\n(l) Aviation gasoline;\n\n(m) Used oil; and\n\n(n) Crude oil.\n\nSource. #6519-B, eff 5-29-97; ss by #8330, eff 4-23-05; ss by #10415, eff 9-24-13 (from Env-A 1603.01); ss by #13808, eff 11-18-23",
